  monsterName: Tikbalang
  lore: The Tikbalang is a tall creature with the head of a horse and the body of
    a man. It wanders forests and mountain trails, delighting in confusing travelers
    by leading them in circles. Although often mischievous rather than evil, a hostile
    Tikbalang fiercely protects its territory and attacks anyone who disturbs the
    sacred forests it calls home
  weakness: Fire
